{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06777","headline":"赵十四兄见访 · 王昌龄","name":"赵十四兄见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客来舒长簟，开合延清风。\n但有无弦琴，共君尽尊中。\n晚来常读易，顷者欲还嵩。\n世事何须道，黄精且养蒙。\n嵇康殊寡识，张翰独知终。\n忽忆鲈鱼鱠，扁舟往江东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}